sion focus.\n- Operates as an OEM, supplying key components for complete elevator systems.","src":"deck","as_of":"14-08-2026"},"other":{"title":"Notable from the deck","body":"- [Management] Chairman & Managing Director Amar Chinubhai Doshi (36+ years in sheet metal fabrication); Whole Time Director Karan Amar Doshi heads production (16+ years); Director & CFO Monish Amar Doshi oversees finance/risk/sales (15+ years in sheet metal, 14+ years in the elevator sector).\n- [Industry - Elevators] Global elevator market sized at USD 86.3B (2026) growing to USD 136.9B (2033) at a 6.8% CAGR; India is cited as the fastest-growing market globally at 9.9% CAGR (2026-2033), growth centred on Mumbai and Bengaluru high-rises.\n- [Industry - SS Sheet] Global stainless-steel sheet market sized at USD 126.09B (2025) growing to USD 211.22B (2034) at a 5.9% CAGR, with Asia Pacific holding a 74.06% share (2025).\n- [Strategic challenge] Deck explicitly flags that converting rising elevator/SS demand into steady long-term growth is currently limited by distribution reach, brand recall and short-term customer relationships, and states addressing these gaps is key to unlocking scalable growth.","src":"deck","as_of":"14-08-2026"}}}